repository-code: "https://github.com/kazuru-chidumbwe/caller-boundary-oracle"
abstract: >-
  A test harness and oracle that decides whether a failed negotiation or
  authentication step inside a library reaches the application that called it.
  Faults are injected by emulated chips into PACE, Chip Authentication and Active
  Authentication; each run is classified as surfaced, status-only, silent, not
  applicable or invalid. The case study covers six eMRTD reader libraries in six
  languages (gmrtd, JMRTD, emrtd-dotnet, dmrtd, NFCPassportReader, passauf) and
  six WebAuthn relying-party libraries.
keywords:
  - test oracle
  - fault injection
  - error handling
  - eMRTD
  - ICAO Doc 9303
  - PACE
